# Project overview

- **Path:** `ecommerce-nextjs/` (lowercase folder at repo root)
- **Stack:** Next.js 16 App Router, Convex (realtime), shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4, TypeScript strict
- **Monorepo:** Web `apps/web` · Mobile `apps/mobile` · Shared `packages/shared` · Backend `convex/` · Python AI service `services/ai-service` (offline content recommendations; not started by `npm run dev`; shoppers do not call it; default recommendation strategy is `convex`)
- **Legacy reference:** React app in `../client/` — port behavior, do not break Convex patterns

## Commands

- Dev: `npm run dev` (Next.js in `apps/web` + `convex dev`)
- Mobile: `npm run mobile:env` then `npm run mobile` (Expo + same Convex backend)
- Seed: `npm run seed`
- Python AI foundation: `npm run dev:python-ai` (independent of `npm run dev`)
- Add UI: `npm run ui:add <component>` (runs in `apps/web`)

## Providers

- `ShadcnProviders` — theme, tooltips, Sonner toasts (root layout)
- `AppProviders` — Convex, cart/filter context (shop layout)
